      "_unverified": true,
      "_unverified_reason": "This category's Southern Fried entry (3100kJ/741 cal, matching the source image exactly on re-verification) diverges ~40% from 2 independent sources that agree with each other (CalorieKing 514 cal, another aggregator 533 cal) - a much larger gap than the Beef category showed on the same spot check (New Yorker: this source's 887 cal vs 731-861 from 2 sources, normal variance). The source image also has at least one confirmed internal error elsewhere (Fried Custard Waffle's carb/sugar/sodium exactly duplicate Choc Brownie Sundae's), so a transcription slip in Burger Urge's own document is plausible for this category specifically. Needs a source that can confirm which figure is current before this can be resolved."
